meta {
  name: List Files
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/files
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  ## Purpose

  Lists stored file metadata. The list uses newest files first.

  ## Authentication

  Requires `files.read`.

  ## Response

  Returns `200 OK` with an array. The `is_used` field is true when a settings logo references the file. Private files have no public URL.
}
